      "content": "Chart type: Bar/Line hybrid chart showing Prosperity Gap values for five individuals. X-axis: Income levels (Tanzania $2.50, Lao PDR $5.00, Uzbekistan $12.50, Bulgaria $25.00, France $50.00). Y-axis: Prosperity Gap (0 to 15). Data points: Tanzania (10), Lao PDR (5), Uzbekistan (2), Bulgaria (1), France (0.5). Annotations: Tanzania needs 10x income to reach $25; Lao PDR needs 5x; Uzbekistan needs 2x; Bulgaria is at 1; France is at 0.5. Comparisons: Tanzania contributes 10x more to the Prosperity Gap than Bulgaria; Lao PDR contributes 5x more than Bulgaria; Uzbekistan contributes 2x more than Bulgaria."
